- Success: `200 OK`
- Path parameters: `id` (integer)

Example request:

```bash
curl -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer $VV_TOKEN" "$VV_URL/api/v1/notification-channels/1/test"
```

Example response:

```json
{"ok": true}
```

## Endpoints: Remote browsers

### GET /api/v1/remote-browsers

List the remote browsers (CDP endpoints) real-browser monitors use. Tokens and passwords in URLs are masked; the first one is the default.

