```

### POST /api/v1/maintenance

Create a window. Times: start_at/end_at in UTC, time_from/time_to local to timezone, weekdays ISO (1 = Monday). Strategies: manual, once, daily, weekly, interval (interval_days, counted from start_at), monthly (month_days like 1,15,-1) and cron (cron + duration_minutes).

- Access: editor (write token of an editor or admin)
- Success: `201 Created`
- Body: JSON object; fields used in the example: `monitor_ids` (array), `strategy` (string), `time_from` (string), `time_to` (string), `timezone` (string), `title` (string), `weekdays` (string)

Example request:

```bash
curl -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer $VV_TOKEN" -H "Content-Type: application/json" "$VV_URL/api/v1/maintenance" -d '{"title": "Database upgrade", "strategy": "weekly", "weekdays": "2,4", "time_from": "22:00", "time_to": "23:30", "timezone": "Europe/Oslo", "monitor_ids": [7]}'
```

